<template name="tus_settings_gui_Machinedrum">
<head>
</head>
<body>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>Panel Rendering</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div id="btPixelPerfectPanel" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Crisp LCD and panel lines (experimental)</label>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Use whole-pixel LCD enlargement and align thin panel lines to pixels. Changes immediately; the LCD may appear smaller with more space around it.</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div id="btLcdRotaryInteraction" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Drag and scroll rotary controls shown on the LCD</label>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Works on synthesis parameters, LFO edit, and Master FX. Menus, tabs, empty cells, and other LCD controls remain inert.</label>

	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>RAM Recording</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div id="btRamRecordingComplete" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Complete RAM recording tails (recommended)</label>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Writes the complete advertised recording extent, preventing old audio from remaining at the end of some recordings.</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div id="btRamRecordingOriginal" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Original RAM recording finalization</label>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Preserves the original OS 1.63 recording logic for exact compatibility.</label>

	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>+Drive</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>No +Drive is connected until you create or import one. In a DAW, the +Drive belongs to the project and is saved with it. The standalone application instead keeps one private, atomically replaced checkpoint. Import and export are explicit sparse .mdpd snapshots.</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<button id="btImportPlusDrive" class="button">Import +Drive Image...</button>
	<button id="btExportPlusDrive" class="button">Export +Drive Image...</button>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label id="plusDriveStatus">PROJECT-OWNED +DRIVE</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<button id="btRebootMachinedrum" class="button">Reboot Machinedrum</button>
	<button id="btResetPlusDrive" class="button">Create Blank +Drive...</button>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Import and blank-drive operations reboot the emulated machine. Standalone changes settle for about one second before checkpointing and are flushed on a clean quit; a forced termination can lose the newest unsettled changes but preserves the previous valid checkpoint. DAW instances never write a hidden external mirror.</label>

	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div class="settings-advanced">
		<h1>Panel Feel</h1>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Sound selection wheel speed</label>
		<table class="settings-table">
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btWheelSpeed50" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>50%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btWheelSpeed75" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>75%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btWheelSpeed100" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>100%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btWheelSpeed150" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>150%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btWheelSpeed200" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>200%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btWheelSpeed300" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>300%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
			</tr>
		</table>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Data entry encoder speed</label>
		<table class="settings-table">
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btEncoderSpeed50" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>50%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btEncoderSpeed75" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>75%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btEncoderSpeed100" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>100%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btEncoderSpeed150" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>150%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btEncoderSpeed200" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>200%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
				<td class="settings-td">
					<div id="btEncoderSpeed300" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
						<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
						<label>300%</label>
					</div>
				</td>
			</tr>
		</table>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
</body>
</template>
